---
import Icon from './MarketingIcon.astro';
import '../styles/challenge.css';
const tools=[['Jira','Intent','The requirement and acceptance criteria behind the change.','jira'],['GitHub','Change','The pull request, diff and reviewer history.','github'],['Security','Risk','Scan results and findings that need attention.','shield'],['GitHub CI','Verification','Build status, test results and deployment checks.','github'],['Claude','AI contribution','Tool usage and the context of AI-assisted work.','code'],['Grafana','Context','Observability context around the release.','chart'],['Prometheus','Signals','Service health and signals around the release.','chart'],['Production','Outcome','The deployed change and its observed outcome.','layers']];
const journey=[['layers','AI Investment','Track usage and cost across tools'],['users','Developer Productivity','Measure real impact on delivery'],['code','Change Analysis','Understand what changed and why'],['shield','Policy & Security','Automated checks with human judgment'],['users','Human Approval','Route exceptions to the right people'],['bolt','Confident Release','Complete audit trail to production']];
---
<section class="challenge" id="teams" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
<div class="challenge-wrap">
<div class="challenge-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE ENGINEERING LEADER’S CHALLENGE</span><h2 id="challenge-title">More code is shipping.<br/><span class="gradient">Who has the full picture?</span></h2></div><p>AI is transforming how software is built. But engineering leaders still struggle to measure its value, keep teams productive, make confident release decisions and maintain a complete audit trail across tools and people.</p></div>
<div class="challenge-controls"><span>Explore the three challenges</span><button type="button" id="challenge-play">Pause walkthrough</button><span id="challenge-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">01 · Measure AI value</span></div>
<div class="challenge-panels">
<article class="challenge-panel active" data-panel="0"><button class="chapter" data-chapter="0" aria-pressed="true"><span class="chapter-number">01</span><span><strong>AI investment & developer productivity</strong><small>Are we getting measurable value from our AI investment?</small></span></button>
<div class="ai-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Compare AI impact"><button type="button" data-mode="before" aria-pressed="false">Before AI</button><button type="button" data-mode="with" aria-pressed="true">With AI</button></div>
<div class="measurement-grid">
<button class="measurement" data-insight="utilization"><span>AI utilization</span><strong data-metric="utilization">0%</strong><small class="adoption">↑ 28%</small><svg viewBox="0 0 160 50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 46 Q25 48 43 39 T70 24 T95 18 T120 13 T157 3"/></svg></button>
<button class="measurement purple" data-insight="throughput"><span>Developer throughput</span><strong data-metric="throughput">0%</strong><div class="mini-bars" aria-hidden="true">{[15,22,31,38,49,63,78,96].map(n=><i style={`--bar:${n}%`}/>)}</div></button>
<button class="measurement green" data-insight="cycle"><span>Cycle time (code to prod)</span><strong data-metric="cycle">0%</strong><svg viewBox="0 0 160 50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 4 Q14 8 30 20 T60 19 T87 26 T112 31 T157 47"/></svg></button>
<button class="measurement teal" data-insight="value"><span>Value / Cost</span><strong data-metric="value">0×</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></button>
</div><div class="challenge-insight" id="ai-insight" aria-live="polite"><span>✦</span><p>High AI adoption is great.<br/>But are we getting real productivity and ROI?</p></div><p class="example-note">Illustrative comparison · changes are relative to the pre-AI baseline.</p></article>
<article class="challenge-panel" data-panel="1"><button class="chapter" data-chapter="1" aria-pressed="false"><span class="chapter-number purple">02</span><span><strong>Release confidence</strong><small>A green pipeline does not explain whether a change meets your policies.</small></span></button>
<div class="govern-pipeline" aria-label="Illustrative release pipeline">{['Build','Tests','Security','Deploy'].map((label,i)=><div data-gate={i}><span class="gate-icon">{i===3?'?':'✓'}</span><strong>{label}</strong></div>)}</div>
<div class="policy-alert" id="challenge-policy"><span class="policy-warning">!</span><div><h3>Policy review required</h3><p>Payment changes require senior review.</p><p class="missing-evidence">⊗ No approval evidence found.</p><button id="policy-details-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="challenge-policy-detail">View policy details <span>→</span></button><div id="challenge-policy-detail" hidden><strong>PAY-07 · Payment-code changes</strong><p>A senior engineer must approve the change before deployment. Build, test and security results verify checks—not a human decision. The release remains blocked until a reviewer’s identity, approval and timestamp are recorded.</p></div></div></div>
<p class="pipeline-caption">A green pipeline doesn’t automatically mean a governed release.</p></article>
<article class="challenge-panel" data-panel="2"><button class="chapter" data-chapter="2" aria-pressed="false"><span class="chapter-number">03</span><span><strong>Scattered evidence</strong><small>Approvals, checks and context are spread across multiple tools and conversations.</small></span></button>
<div class="evidence-map"><svg class="evidence-wires" viewBox="0 0 400 220" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">{[30,82,136,188].map(y=><><path d={`M92 ${y} C165 ${y} 125 110 177 110`}/><path d={`M308 ${y} C235 ${y} 275 110 223 110`}/></>)}</svg><div class="evidence-center" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>{tools.map(([name,label,desc,icon],i)=><button class="evidence-tool" style={`grid-column:${i%2+1};grid-row:${Math.floor(i/2)+1}`} data-tool={name} data-evidence-label={label} data-evidence-description={desc}>{['jira','github','gitlab'].includes(icon)?<img src={`/${icon}.svg`} alt="" width="22" height="22"/>:<Icon name={icon}/>}<span>{name}</span></button>)}</div>
<div class="evidence-question" id="evidence-explanation" aria-live="polite"><span>?</span><p><strong>Where is the complete release decision?</strong><small>Evidence is fragmented across tools, teams and conversations.</small></p></div></article>
</div>
<div class="connection-bridge" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M200 0V15Q200 35 240 35H560Q600 35 600 60"/><path d="M600 0V60"/><path d="M1000 0V15Q1000 35 960 35H640Q600 35 600 60"/></svg></div>
<div class="challenge-solution"><div class="solution-copy"><span class="solution-label">THE SOLUTION</span><h3 id="solution-message">Measure the value.<br/>Govern the change.<br/>Prove the outcome.</h3><p>DryDock connects your AI investment to real engineering outcomes—with governance built in.</p><a class="button" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span>→</span></a></div><div class="solution-flow"><div class="connect-title"><span>✦</span> DryDock connects it all</div><div class="outcome-journey">{journey.map(([icon,title,desc],i)=><div class="outcome-step" data-outcome={i}><Icon name={icon}/><h4>{title}</h4><p>{desc}</p></div>)}</div><p class="outcome-note">Illustrative connected workflow. The example release above still requires approval.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<script>
const root=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.challenge')!;
const reduced=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
const chapters=Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-chapter]'));
const panels=Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-panel]'));
const play=root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#challenge-play')!;
const status=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#challenge-status')!;
let elapsed=0,last=0,frame=0,running=false,started=false,currentChapter=-1,mode='with',visible=false;
const stageNames=['01 · Measure AI value','02 · Govern release decisions','03 · Connect the evidence'];
function chapter(index:number){if(index===currentChapter)return;currentChapter=index;panels.forEach((p,i)=>p.classList.toggle('active',i===index));chapters.forEach((b,i)=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(i===index)));status.textContent=stageNames[index];}
function numbers(progress=1){const targets=mode==='with'?[74,31,22,2.3]:[0,0,0,0];root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-metric]').forEach((el,i)=>{const v=targets[i]*progress;el.textContent=i===3?(mode==='before'?'—':v.toFixed(1)+'×'):(i===1&&v>0?'+':i===2&&v>0?'−':'')+Math.round(v)+'%';});root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.adoption')!.hidden=mode==='before';root.classList.toggle('before-ai',mode==='before');}
function gates(n:number){root.querySelectorAll('[data-gate]').forEach((el,i)=>{el.classList.toggle('passed',i<n&&i<3);el.classList.toggle('blocked',i===3&&n===4);});root.querySelector('#challenge-policy')!.classList.toggle('revealed',n===4);}
function outcomes(n:number){root.querySelectorAll('[data-outcome]').forEach((el,i)=>el.classList.toggle('reached',i<n));root.style.setProperty('--outcome-progress',`${Math.max(0,(n-1)/5)*100}%`);root.classList.toggle('connected',n>0);root.classList.toggle('complete',n===6);root.querySelector('#solution-message')!.innerHTML=n===6?'AI investment →<br/>engineering outcome.<br/>Now you can prove both.':'Measure the value.<br/>Govern the change.<br/>Prove the outcome.';}
function render(t:number){chapter(t<2600?0:t<5000?1:2);numbers(Math.min(1,t/1400));gates(t<2800?0:t<3300?1:t<3800?2:t<4300?3:4);root.classList.toggle('gathering',t>=5000);outcomes(t<6500?0:Math.min(6,Math.floor((t-6500)/420)+1));}
function pause(){running=false;cancelAnimationFrame(frame);play.textContent=elapsed>=9000?'Replay walkthrough':'Resume walkthrough';root.classList.remove('playing');}
function tick(now:number){if(!running)return;elapsed=Math.min(9000,elapsed+Math.min(now-last,80));last=now;render(elapsed);if(elapsed>=9000){pause();status.textContent='Connected workflow complete';return;}frame=requestAnimationFrame(tick);}
function start(){if(reduced){render(9000);elapsed=9000;play.textContent='Replay overview';status.textContent='Overview · motion reduced';return;}running=true;last=performance.now();play.textContent='Pause walkthrough';root.classList.add('playing');frame=requestAnimationFrame(tick);}
function manual(index:number){elapsed=[1400,4300,5500][index];pause();render(elapsed);numbers();chapter(index);}
chapters.forEach((button,i)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>manual(i)));
play.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(running){pause();return;}if(elapsed>=9000){elapsed=0;mode='with';root.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.getAttribute('data-mode')===mode)));}start();});
const insights:Record<string,string>={utilization:'AI adoption is up 28%. Delivery throughput improved 31%, while cycle time dropped 22%.',throughput:'Developer throughput is up 31% compared with the pre-AI baseline in this example.',cycle:'Cycle time is down 22% compared with the pre-AI baseline in this example.',value:'Illustrative value / cost: estimated engineering value divided by AI tool cost = 2.3×. This is a sample ratio, not a customer result.'};
root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-mode]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{manual(0);mode=button.dataset.mode!;root.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button)));numbers();root.querySelector('#ai-insight p')!.textContent=mode==='before'?'Before AI: the baseline for throughput and cycle time. No AI utilization or AI value/cost ratio.':insights.utilization;}));
root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-insight]').forEach(button=>{const reveal=()=>{root.querySelector('#ai-insight p')!.textContent=mode==='before'?'Pre-AI baseline: switch to With AI to compare the example outcomes.':insights[button.dataset.insight!];button.classList.remove('graph-motion');void button.offsetWidth;button.classList.add('graph-motion');};button.addEventListener('pointerenter',reveal);button.addEventListener('focus',reveal);button.addEventListener('click',()=>{manual(0);reveal();});});
root.querySelector('#policy-details-toggle')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{manual(1);const button=root.querySelector('#policy-details-toggle')!;const open=button.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#challenge-policy-detail')!.hidden=!open;});
root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tool]').forEach(button=>{const reveal=()=>{const box=root.querySelector('#evidence-explanation')!;box.querySelector('strong')!.textContent=`${button.dataset.tool} → ${button.dataset.evidenceLabel}`;box.querySelector('small')!.textContent=button.dataset.evidenceDescription!;root.querySelectorAll('[data-tool]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b===button));};button.addEventListener('pointerenter',reveal);button.addEventListener('focus',reveal);button.addEventListener('click',()=>{manual(2);reveal();});});
new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{visible=entries[0].isIntersecting;if(visible&&!started){started=true;start();}else if(!visible&&running){pause();}},{threshold:.2}).observe(root);
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden&&running)pause();});
if(reduced){render(9000);elapsed=9000;play.textContent='Replay overview';}
</script>
